'''Jinglegun''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by giving 100 [[Gifts]] {{Currency|Old Gift}} (equivalent to a total of 100,000 [[Snow Tokens]] {{Currency|Snow Token}}) to players during the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Jinglegun’s upper barrel and frame use a russet color, while its under barrel, cylinder, and handle are a deep green with goldish accents. The hammer and trigger are also a goldish color, and wrapped around the whole gun is a thick lines of Christmas lights varying in different colors, such as red, green, and yellow.

== Trivia ==
* This was obtained the same way as [[Lugercane]] (from the previous year), by purchasing gifts and giving them to other players.
* This is commonly paired with [[Xmas]], a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife bought with 75 [[gifts 2015]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015]], however they are not considered a set.

